sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Retailer
    participant UI as Retailer Mobile App
    participant ShipmentAPI as ShipmentsController
    participant ShipmentService
    participant ShipmentStore
    participant ComplaintAPI as ComplaintsController
    participant ComplaintService
    participant ComplaintStore
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    %% ==========================================
    %% 1. VIEW SHIPMENT DETAILS
    %% ==========================================

    Retailer->>+UI: Open Order Delivery Details

    UI->>+ShipmentAPI: Get(shipmentId)
    ShipmentAPI->>+ShipmentService: GetAsync(shipmentId)

    ShipmentService->>+ShipmentStore: FindByIdAsync(shipmentId)

    ShipmentStore->>+DB: SELECT Shipment and dispatched items
    DB-->>ShipmentStore: Shipment information
    deactivate DB

    ShipmentStore-->>ShipmentService: ShipmentView
    deactivate ShipmentStore

    ShipmentService-->>ShipmentAPI: Shipment details
    deactivate ShipmentService

    ShipmentAPI-->>UI: Shipment response
    deactivate ShipmentAPI

    UI-->>Retailer: Display dispatched and received quantities
    deactivate UI

    %% ==========================================
    %% 2. REPORT RECEIPT DISCREPANCY
    %% ==========================================

    Retailer->>+UI: Select Report Issue

    Retailer->>UI: Select affected shipment items

    Retailer->>UI: Enter issue type, quantity and reason

    Retailer->>UI: Attach evidence images

    Note over Retailer,UI: Issue types include missing, damaged or incorrect goods

    Note over UI,ComplaintAPI: Evidence images are uploaded separately and referenced in the complaint request

    %% ==========================================
    %% 3. SUBMIT COMPLAINT
    %% ==========================================

    UI->>+ComplaintAPI: Create(complaintData)

    ComplaintAPI->>+ComplaintService: CreateAsync(complaintData)

    ComplaintService->>+ComplaintStore: CreateAsync(actorId, complaintData)

    %% ==========================================
    %% 4. VALIDATE ORDER AND SHIPMENT
    %% ==========================================

    ComplaintStore->>+DB: SELECT SalesOrder, Shipment and Retailer
    DB-->>ComplaintStore: Order ownership and shipment status
    deactivate DB

    ComplaintStore->>+DB: SELECT dispatched and received batch quantities
    DB-->>ComplaintStore: Shipment line and receipt information
    deactivate DB

    alt Retailer is not authorized

        ComplaintStore-->>ComplaintService: Forbidden error

    else Shipment is not eligible for complaint

        ComplaintStore-->>ComplaintService: Conflict error

    else Retailer and Shipment are valid

        %% ==========================================
        %% 5. VALIDATE DISCREPANCY ITEMS
        %% ==========================================

        ComplaintStore->>+DB: SELECT existing discrepancies for affected items
        DB-->>ComplaintStore: Previously reported quantities
        deactivate DB

        Note over ComplaintStore,DB: Validate affected Batch, quantity, issue type and evidence

        alt Invalid quantity, evidence or duplicate claim

            ComplaintStore-->>ComplaintService: Validation or conflict error

        else Complaint information is valid

            %% ==========================================
            %% 6. CALCULATE DISPUTED VALUE
            %% ==========================================

            ComplaintStore->>+DB: SELECT actual final batch prices
            DB-->>ComplaintStore: Batch price snapshots
            deactivate DB

            Note right of ComplaintStore: Calculate disputed value from affected quantities and actual net prices

            %% ==========================================
            %% 7. SAVE RECEIPT DISCREPANCY
            %% ==========================================

            ComplaintStore->>+DB: INSERT ReceiptDiscrepancy and ReceiptDiscrepancyItems
            Note right of DB: Save issue details, quantities, evidence references and reported value

            DB-->>ComplaintStore: Complaint created
            deactivate DB

            ComplaintStore-->>ComplaintService: ComplaintResult

        end

    end

    deactivate ComplaintStore

    %% ==========================================
    %% 8. RETURN COMPLAINT RESULT
    %% ==========================================

    ComplaintService-->>ComplaintAPI: Complaint result or business error
    deactivate ComplaintService

    ComplaintAPI-->>UI: Complaint submission response
    deactivate ComplaintAPI

    UI-->>Retailer: Display complaint status or error
    deactivate UI

    %% ==========================================
    %% BUSINESS CONSTRAINTS
    %% ==========================================

    Note over ComplaintService,DB: Complaint submission does not change physical inventory

    Note over ComplaintService,DB: Actual receipt quantities and delivery history remain unchanged

    Note over Retailer,DB: Complaint investigation and resolution are handled separately